@host = http://localhost:5246

### Verificar se a API está no ar
GET {{host}}/api/contas

### Buscar conta existente (deve retornar 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/contas/1
Accept: application/json

### Buscar conta inexistente (deve retornar 404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/contas/99
Accept: application/json

### Criar nova conta (deve retornar 201 Created)
POST {{host}}/api/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 2,
  "numero": 1003,
  "tipo": "Corrente",
  "saldo": 2500.00
}

### Atualizar conta 2 (deve retornar 204 No Content)
PUT {{BancoAula.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contas/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "Poupanca",
  "saldo": 6000.00,
  "ativa": true
}